{"parse": {"title": "CO-12", "pageid": 100924, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/CO-11\" title=\"CO-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">CO-12</span><a href=\"/wiki/CO-13\" title=\"CO-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">CO</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">12</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E3.80.8A.E5.8D.8F.E5.A5.8F.E6.9B.B2.E3.80.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"《协奏曲》\">《协奏曲》</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 《协奏曲》</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Concerto</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>嘶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>嘶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>蛇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>噼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>啪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>火<span class=\"color-value\"></span>花<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>量<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尺<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>乌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>鸦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>玻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>璃<span class=\"color-value\"></span>鱼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>缸<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>乱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>糟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>糟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>但<span class=\"color-value\"></span>砰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>砰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>作<span class=\"color-value\"></span>响<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2710112</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">1987 普列谢茨克发射基地<br />暴雨前两个月</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与平日相比，实验室里并没有太多不同。尽管伙伴们已经尽力将散落的小物件摆放齐整，但显然这种有序性难以得到维持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六将最后一叠文件推到桌面角落，退后几步打量着自己收拾出的成果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我准备好了。你们也记得尽量保持安全距离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>医疗队会在近期撤离，所以我们得尽量小心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您真的不需要我来做测试人员吗？我的神秘术已经足够熟练了，完全能保护自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>当然不能是你，宇航员身上不能有伤疤，它们会因为升空时的高压开裂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>放心，这次成功率很高。多次数据核验和模拟都没什么毛病。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>以防万一，我今天早上起来还对着软盘读了好几篇露西女士的演讲稿，还有拉普拉斯神秘术科技化应用领域的前沿论文，试图让它做好足够的心理准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>可是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>库珀花环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六很少郑重其事地称呼谁。小宇航员不禁站直了身子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>带其他人撤退到隔离门外面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>考虑到场地问题，我会用自己的神秘术给周围做隔热墙，尽力来点预防措施。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>毕竟需要实时沟通情况，隔得太远的话通讯信号会被电磁影响，所以你们还是得待在门外。我已经尽可能把风险降到最低啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>如果出了什么事，你要怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我会管好自己。你得开始熟悉一些流程，总会用得上的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>除非有谁主动退出，否则出了事就轮流顶上，直到没人能接手。说不定最后全得靠你一个呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我没有那么多经验……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>现在下结论还早，别随便就说做不到啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻轻推了一把小宇航员的肩膀，让她往后退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自动门开始合拢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-311714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她没有来得及说完话，门扉便彻底关闭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>哪来那么多严肃的告别，浪费时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>桌子上是……谁的工牌？指针走的时候肯定把她的东西全收拾好了。八成是北方哨歌的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她仔细确认了上面的文字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>还真是。也不知道她怎么进的分部大楼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>启动软盘之前，她把这项意外收获挂在了脖子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>给她来个惊喜。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空荡的会议室里，磁流体和理线学者分别占据了大门左右两侧的少部分空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>会议桌边的位置并不舒适，谁都不想在闲暇时坐过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你对他们有多大把握？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>或者说，按你的评估看，拿回的数据是否真能帮助我们找到“暴雨”的真相？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这可谁也没法保证。虽然我们是“拉普拉斯科算中心”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>全知全能的拉普拉斯妖究竟把故事读到哪儿了？谁知道呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我个人是不喜欢被剧透结局的那一派。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我也是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体耸了耸肩，正打算从最近关注的高新技术中挑选一个有趣的例子延续话题，熟悉的声音却不适时地响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-633220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-633220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-633220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">监测器：</div><div>有人在度假？真悠闲。真悠闲！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633221.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-633221.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633221.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633221.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-633221.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633221.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-633221.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633221.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>找到他们了。感谢您的努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体的发声装置卡壳了片刻才成功喊出声音的归属者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……阿德勒研究员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>路德维希先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>理线学者的脸上一片愕然。磁流体的疑惑更明显，它明白地展示了大大的“！”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>停在机器头顶的渡鸦也歪了歪脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-633201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-633201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-633201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>很高兴听到两位有这样的研究热情。同样感谢你们的努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>我来此等候冷周六研究员，并替露西女士转交“暴雨”监测器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>考虑到实际的物资使用情况，以及时间紧迫，由一个小组对原有的机器进行了必要改造。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>它原本在科算中心承担日程汇报及工作提醒服务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>阿德勒研究员的事我有所耳闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>出于同事间的人道主义关怀，他们收集了阿德勒曾经的发言数据，合成了语音包，把这台机器送到他的房间门口，试图让他和外界保证一定的社会化接触。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>结果是它被“退货”了。因此转往其他方向出力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我明白。合理利用资源是正确的决定。但我觉得“人道主义关怀”可以有更明确的执行标准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>感谢理解。露西女士为你提交的休假理由也是“人道主义关怀”，看来你在普列谢茨克分部休养的期间，对这一词汇有了更多了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>渡鸦显然对这份沉默十分满意，它不再发表任何意见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌在监测器的屏幕上点了几下，为自己的新发现露出微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>让我瞧瞧这个监测器——可选的语音包还挺多。“钢铁的炼成方案”，我猜这采样自露西女士的会议发言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-307711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-307711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-307711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>还有那位大明星玛丽莲小姐的。啊，这是斯普特尼克一号的播报语音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>“毛绒且温暖的陪伴”？这又是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-633210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-633210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-633210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">监测器：</div><div><b>’&amp;#*（&amp;！</b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>他们不该把时间都浪费在这种地方。送上太空的监测器怎么会需要魔精语音包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>放轻松点，大家总得有办法缓解工作压力嘛。我觉得还挺有意思的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>噢，看来时间刚好。冷周六也准备好了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>现场汇报。我启动了软盘，但它没有反应，猜测是某个部分读数有误。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>噢，提示灯在闪烁，是红灯。这说明它的确有蓄积神秘学能量，并且很可能在按照我限定的范围进行定位校准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但多出的能量似乎被用在了其他地方，这个术式的耗能是守恒的——所以它很可能会连带我附近的东西一起传送走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-633320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-633320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-633320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>……你还有什么想交代的吗？我愿意收养你办公室里能幸存下来的鱼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>耐心点，我觉得它在努力了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她甩了甩这枚软盘，但当她停下动作时，软盘依然在轻微地摇晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——剧烈地摇晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>整间办公室似乎都跟着发起抖来，生态缸里的鱼不安地来回游动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>哈，很遗憾，我觉得可能不会有幸存的鱼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>祝我一路顺风——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在会议室的地面开始起伏之前，监测器灵活地退到了走廊上的安全地带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌也猛地贴紧了墙壁，试图稳住身体。<br />抬头时，她发现磁流体的玻璃外壳在震动，内容物摇晃着散开成许多小颗粒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>乌尔里希，我简直能听到你头脑风暴的声音——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……！……，……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玻璃破碎声使北方哨歌多瞧了几眼旁边的同事，确认磁流体仍然好端端地待在外壳里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>造成动静的是从半空中坠落的鱼缸，以及——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>嘿，各位小心！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我得说实话，冷周六，打个招呼用不上这么大的排场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我——听——不——清——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无论是耳机里还是眼前的话语声都相当模糊，似乎随着空间的移动被撕扯得变形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员在半空中调整好了姿态，稳当地落在会议桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不提那条从石头鱼缸里飞出来的倒霉小鱼，这个见面招呼还算不错。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>躺在地板上的鱼有气无力地拍打着尾巴，远不如落在乌尔里希头顶时精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>可怜的鱼，它肯定没救了。就算我在中途把鱼缸变成石棉石，防止玻璃摔破，也没能防住它被甩出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>嗯……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提到自己的神秘术，她慌忙低头查看手里向北方哨歌递出的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它的重量显著增加。这应该是拉普拉斯首块拥有石棉石挂带的工牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>糟糕，没反应过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>还好不是重要部分！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她眨了眨眼，让神秘术的辉光完全褪去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这还挺罕见。我会带着它多走走，让大家瞧个稀奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>忙着抢救头顶那只可怜生物的磁流体将小鱼放回鱼缸，直起身子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>——恭喜你，冷周六女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你的研究成果相当惊人，我必须向你致以真诚的掌声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这么——这么严肃吗？我的确很高兴，不过——总之还是谢谢您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我也得说声恭喜。以及，这是不是说明你能保证让我的小学徒平安回到地球了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>完全可以，虽然这基本上是为了计划临时改进的软盘，还不能推广应用……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633221.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-633221.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633221.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633221.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-633221.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633221.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-633221.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633221.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>但已经足够说服我了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>渡鸦乘着它的机械座椅靠近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>我同意批准你的延迟撤离申请书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>耳机里的欢呼先一步响起，冷周六还在回想刚刚听到的句子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但我还……没有把它交给您？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“路德维希”：</div><div>我的意思是，你现在就可以提交它。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>所以这就是你带着一张支离破碎的申请书返回的原因？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>我佩服你们竟然能把它重新拼起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众多目光短暂地聚焦在这张薄薄的、由胶带粘合的、几乎难以辨认清原本字迹的纸张上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>好吧，传送过程中还是不适合携带无防护的纸制品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>没关系，我们离成功很近了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>接下来我只需要坚持训练，保持最佳状态，直到发射当天。我明白的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>站在库珀花环身侧的少女轻轻拍了拍库珀花环的肩膀，努力表达自己的意见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我明白你的意思。我会注意自己的身体状况的。谢谢你，远旅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>也没剩多少时间，你可以适当地多歇一歇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>我建议你为了庆祝这次成功，给自己放个短暂的假期，一天也行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我相信冷周六女士会有接下来的安排……还有很多事得忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环向沉思着的研究员投去询问的眼神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>安排……我是安排了一些重要事项。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>教会你监测器的使用流程，进行发射前的安全检查，确认传送软盘的最终锁定坐标……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>噢，对。我这次去取监测器还学到了一个新鲜词，我们也的确有执行它的必要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>“人道主义休假”。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "CO-12"}}